OoT Online's changes to nxnative (commit in NXNATIVE_COMMIT, after the three fix patches), for reading: tools/integrate_nxnative.py
is what makes them (it copies client/ into dm/host and checks each edit against the text it replaces). Made 2026-11-11 on a clean tree.

